  "review": "Inspected all 41 changed/new captures at original size and compared reviewed baselines; 473 unchanged images retain their existing reviews. New native Appearance, independently selected bar geometry, precise X/Y movement, snapping settings and bounded mover grid use actual addon widgets. Refreshed 53 affected scenarios plus two corrected detail crops and 22 repeated scenes after the finalized shared-theme dependency scope rejected stale provenance. Private Studio scenes are retained as regression evidence while public Studio remains withdrawn; review is not a claim that Studio UX is ready.",
  "limitations": [
    "Game-client behavior is accepted by the user's standing policy; no agent-observed native playtest claimed.",
    "Fine grid display is decimated to at most 256 lines; actual snapping retains the configured 1–32-unit interval.",
    "Native and browser alignment thresholds differ; equivalent precision controls do not imply identical drag outcomes.",
    "Existing unsupported renderer behavior remains explicitly documented; private Studio UX issues remain the reason for public withdrawal."
  ]
